Closeout record: end the final reply of a turn that changed files or ran commands with this block, with its delivery, blocker and who must act in it instead of a separate delivery line. A turn that only answered needs none; one ending with an optional question or offer writes Status done with no Missing.

<closeout …>

Merged and Deployed: yes only if this exact change is merged or running in production, else no, or n/a; they are checked, and a false yes is worse than no. Did: up to three plain sentences. Artifact: one per line; a file for the user is `file <absolute path>`. Verified: what you ran and its reading, or untested. Missing: only what someone else must supply. Blocked: name who or what in Waiting. Next, only when done: one short follow-up in the owner's voice before the final ---. Write the content in Simplified Chinese.